    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend against waves of enemies!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128240/extras/03c65ad005916e3ea767297ff122ebcb.avif?t=1734604190\" width=616 height=170 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Waves of enemies, with difficulty settings<br></li><li>Armour mechanic for enemy vehicles<br></li><li>Fictional weapons and vehicles, with realistic style</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Load, aim and shoot!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128240/extras/3eec8f7106faebc3d6930e665d68f990.avif?t=1734604190\" width=616 height=170 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Both realistic physics based, and arcade automatic reload are present to fit any playstyles.<br></li><li>Multiple ammo types (armour piercing, and high explosive currently)<br></li><li>Ballistics, so do not forget the bullet drop!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive environment</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128240/extras/9a3af6e31679d3c1fdff02f73b8db5eb.avif?t=1734604190\" width=616 height=170 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic environment and sound design<br></li><li>Destructable buildings</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend against waves of enemies!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128240/extras/03c65ad005916e3ea767297ff122ebcb.avif?t=1734604190\" width=616 height=170 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Waves of enemies, with difficulty settings<br></li><li>Armour mechanic for enemy vehicles<br></li><li>Fictional weapons and vehicles, with realistic style</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Load, aim and shoot!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128240/extras/3eec8f7106faebc3d6930e665d68f990.avif?t=1734604190\" width=616 height=170 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Both realistic physics based, and arcade automatic reload are present to fit any playstyles.<br></li><li>Multiple ammo types (armour piercing, and high explosive currently)<br></li><li>Ballistics, so do not forget the bullet drop!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive environment</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128240/extras/9a3af6e31679d3c1fdff02f73b8db5eb.avif?t=1734604190\" width=616 height=170 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic environment and sound design<br></li><li>Destructable buildings</li></ul>",
